cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenCarbon · Forest Fire-Debt EO Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  An open Google Earth Engine + Colab toolkit to quantify the biomass, carbon,
  methane and other gases released by Mediterranean forest fires from free
  optical (Sentinel-2), thermal (MODIS) and atmospheric (Sentinel-5P) satellite
  data, test whether the methane plume was detectable from orbit, and model
  post-fire canopy and methane-sink recovery. Showcase: the 2020 Arischia fire,
  L'Aquila, Italy.
